{"id":"5694ee3fbead","publishedAt":1794962100000,"posts":[[{"bold":true,"text":"【順位戦Ａ級】千田翔太八段が佐々木勇気八段に勝ち、１勝４敗に　佐々木八段２勝３敗"},{"br":1},{"href":"https://i2chmeijin.com/blog-category-14.html","text":"順位戦"},{"text":" \n 2026/11/18"},{"text":"00:35"},{"text":"43"},{"br":1},{"size":13,"text":"北〕Ａ級順位戦を中継しています。同い年対決。相掛かりに進んでいます。本局の解説棋士は梶浦宏孝七段。夕食休憩後、出演いただきます😎。\n\n【将棋ライブ】▲千田翔太八段（０勝４敗）ー△佐々木勇気八段（２勝２敗）【第85期将棋名人戦・A級順位戦】 "},{"size":13,"text":"https://t.co/87YVFyeqxH"},{"size":13,"text":"https://t.co/bWE2kxTMgf"},{"br":1},{"size":13,"text":"— 朝日新聞将棋取材班 (@asahi_shogi) "},{"size":13,"href":"https://x.com/asahi_shogi/status/2122504718895423743?ref_src=twsrc%5Etfw","text":"November 17, 2026"},{"br":1},{"size":13,"text":"\n名人戦・順位戦棋譜速報"},{"br":1},{"size":13,"href":"http://www.meijinsen.jp/","text":"http://www.meijinsen.jp/"},{"br":1},{"color":"#333333","size":13,"text":"スポンサーリンク"},{"br":1},{"size":13,"text":"\nＡ級５回戦\n\n"},{"br":1},{"size":13,"text":"\n07千田　翔太（１勝４敗） ○－● 06佐々木　勇気（２勝３敗）\n\n"}],[{"bold":true,"size":16,"text":"\n死闘だった すごい将棋 "},{"br":1},{"size":10,"text":"\n引用元："},{"size":10,"text":"https://mevius.5ch.io/test/read.cgi/bgame/1794828962/"},{"br":1},{"href":"https://i2chmeijin.com/blog-entry-24102.html?sp&m2=form","text":"コメント"},{"br":1},{"href":"https://i2chmeijin.com/blog-entry-24102.html?sp&m2=form","text":"を書く"},{"br":1},{"href":"https://i2chmeijin.com/blog-entry-24102.html?sp&m2=res","text":"コメント"},{"br":1},{"href":"https://i2chmeijin.com/blog-entry-24102.html?sp&m2=res","text":"(43)"}]],"comments":[]}